description:
Add time provider trait for GNSS and fallback time sources.

## File
rust/lichen-hal/src/time.rs (new or extend existing)

## Trait Definition
```rust
/// Time provider abstraction for GNSS and fallback sources.
pub trait TimeProvider {
    /// Get current unix time in milliseconds.
    /// Returns None if time is unavailable or not yet synchronized.
    fn unix_time_ms(&self) -> Option<u64>;

    /// Check if GNSS fix is available and time is accurate.
    fn has_gnss(&self) -> bool;

    /// Time source quality: 0=GNSS, 1=NTP, 2=RTC, 3=monotonic
    fn stratum(&self) -> u8 {
        if self.has_gnss() { 0 } else { 3 }
    }
}
```

